  clock: 3  # 49e3
  nonce: '49e3'  # 49e3
  message: "Fixed in PR #1972 (dacb8bb75d): wolfram registers find_files=find_wolfram_files, so the profile counts the .m files its finder reads and the pre-filter no longer skips a .m-only package. Re-run on merged dev, live: a repo holding only Geometry.m (BeginPackage / area[r_] := Pi r^2) -> hypergumbo survey rc=0, profile.languages.wolfram.files=1, the wolfram pass files_analyzed=1 silence_reason None, symbol area emitted (before: files 0, pass skipped as no_candidate_files). Gate: test_no_finder_override_reads_files_its_taxonomy_entry_cannot_see runs every override with no registered finder on a probe tree; before the fix it named wolfram alone (clojure, fsharp, latex, markdown read subsets). Corpus: 29 .m files, none Wolfram -- no repo changed."  # 49e3
